  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="section section-soft stripe-top" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="intro-title">What is a vehicle wrap?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Self-adhesive cast vinyl applied to bodywork. Your vehicle becomes a mobile billboard visible to anyone in the street, on the motorway or at the customer's doorstep.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:var(--space-9); align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <p>Three formats are common. <strong>Partial lettering</strong> places logo, phone number and website on the side panels and rear door &mdash; the fastest and most affordable route to a branded vehicle. <strong>Partial wrap</strong> covers selected panels in solid colour with overlaid lettering and graphics. <strong>Full wrap</strong> covers every visible body panel and lets you change the base colour of the vehicle entirely.</p>
          <p>For most Rotterdam SMEs a partial lettering or partial wrap delivers the best return. It is cheaper to produce, faster to install, and still highly visible from a distance. A full wrap makes sense when the vehicle is also the brand &mdash; food trucks, festival vans, premium service vehicles, customer-facing fleet.</p>
          <p>We have been wrapping vehicles for Rotterdam businesses since 2012. The installation is carried out in our heated indoor workshop in Rotterdam Zuidoost. You drop off the vehicle in the morning and pick it up in the afternoon or the following day, fully wrapped and quality-checked.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>Materials we use:</p>
          <ul style="list-style:disc; padding-left:var(--space-5); color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:var(--lh-base); margin-top:var(--space-3);">
            <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">3M IJ-series with 3M overlaminate</strong> &mdash; the industry-standard combination. UV-stable for seven years, conforms to compound curves, removes cleanly within the design life.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Avery Dennison MPI 1105 with DOL laminate</strong> &mdash; premium alternative with stronger conformability for vans with deep panel recesses and rivets.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Hexis Skintac</strong> &mdash; European cast vinyl, suitable for specialist colours and short-run promotional wraps.</li>
            <li><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Orafol ORACAL 970RA</strong> &mdash; brushed, metallic and matte-chrome finishes for colour-change wraps and premium aesthetic upgrades.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

