        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Electrical contractors</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Electricians and cable specialists often work at visible addresses for long periods. A well-lettered van parked outside is free advertising for the duration of the job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Cleaning &amp; facility services</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Cleaning firms operate early mornings in residential areas — high visibility, receptive audience. Fleet consistency across multiple vehicles builds brand recognition quickly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" role="listitem">
          <h3 class="card__title">Food &amp; delivery services</h3>
          <p class="card__body">Food trucks, catering vans and delivery fleets need maximum impact. Full wraps with high-contrast print are the standard; partial lettering suffices for straightforward courier and logistics vans.</p>
