        <li style="padding:var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);"><strong>2. Free digital mockup within 48 hours.</strong> We produce a to-scale mockup of the wrap on a silhouette of your exact vehicle make and model. Revisions are unlimited and free.</li>
        <li style="padding:var(--space-4) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);"><strong>3. Approval and production.</strong> After sign-off, the vinyl is printed or cut at our Rotterdam production partners. Lead time three to five working days. A-brand material only (3M, Avery, Hexis, Orafol).</li>
